### Sattadhar Textile — Staff accounts & menu assignment
### VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). Run top to bottom.
###
### The point of this file is the SAFETY RAILS block (steps 9–14): watch the
### server refuse an owner-only menu key, refuse a staff token on an owner-only
### report, refuse deactivating the last owner, and refuse an owner switching
### off the account they are signed in with.

@base = http://localhost:4000
@api = {{base}}/api/v1

### ─── 1. Login as ADMIN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "ChangeMe@123" }

###
@adminAccess = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@adminId = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.user.id}}

### ─── 2. What may be assigned, and what never can ───────────────────────
### `adminOnlyMenus` is the list the staff form never renders.
GET {{api}}/admin/staff/options
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 3. Create a staff member with ONLY Billing + Customers ────────────
### Deliberately narrow: no Dashboard, no Products, no Stock, no Khata.
# @name createStaff
POST {{api}}/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Counter",
  "username": "counter1",
  "password": "Counter@2026",
  "role": "STAFF",
  "preferredLang": "EN",
  "maxDiscountPercent": 2,
  "permissions": { "customer.create": true, "payment.record": true },
  "menuAccess": ["BILLING", "CUSTOMERS"]
}

###
@staffId = {{createStaff.response.body.data.id}}

### ─── 4. Sign in as that staff member ───────────────────────────────────
# @name staffLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "counter1", "password": "Counter@2026" }

###
@staffAccess = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ─── 5. Their effective menu — expect exactly BILLING + CUSTOMERS ──────
GET {{api}}/me/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 6. The owner's own menu — expect the full set incl. REPORTS/STAFF ─
GET {{api}}/me/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 7. Give them Stock (view) as well ─────────────────────────────────
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "menuAccess": ["BILLING", "CUSTOMERS", "STOCK"] }

### ─── 8. Re-check their menu — STOCK is now there ───────────────────────
GET {{api}}/me/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}


### ══ SAFETY RAILS ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 9. Try to assign an owner-only screen → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR ──────
### This is the curl path the form can never take. The message names the reason.
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "menuAccess": ["BILLING", "REPORTS"] }

### ─── 10. And stock valuation, and this very screen → 400 each ──────────
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "menuAccess": ["BILLING", "OUTSTANDING", "STAFF"] }

### ─── 11. A key the app does not have at all → 400 ──────────────────────
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "menuAccess": ["STOCK_VALUATION"] }

### ─── 12. Staff token on an owner-only report → 403, menus irrelevant ───
### The menu never came into it. This is the actual boundary.
GET {{api}}/reports/profit-margin
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 13. Staff token on stock valuation → 403 ──────────────────────────
GET {{api}}/stock/valuation
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 14. Staff token on staff management itself → 403 ──────────────────
GET {{api}}/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 15. Owner deactivating their own account → 403 ────────────────────
POST {{api}}/admin/staff/{{adminId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 16. Demoting the last active owner → 409 CONFLICT ─────────────────
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "STAFF" }

### ─── 17. Username already taken → 409 CONFLICT ─────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Duplicate", "username": "counter1", "password": "Counter@2026" }

### ─── 18. Khata without Customers → 400, it would be unreachable ────────
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "menuAccess": ["BILLING", "KHATA"] }


### ══ DEACTIVATION & PASSWORD ════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 19. Deactivate → revokedSessions tells you they were signed in ────
POST {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 20. Their still-unexpired token → 401 immediately, not later ──────
GET {{api}}/me/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 21. Back on ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 22. Reset their password ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newPassword": "Counter@2027" }

### ─── 23. Old password → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS ────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "counter1", "password": "Counter@2026" }

### ─── 24. New password → 200 ────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "counter1", "password": "Counter@2027" }

### ─── 25. Clear a lockout without touching the password ─────────────────
POST {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 26. The list, with the assignment on every row ────────────────────
GET {{api}}/admin/staff?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}
